{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8ef4eeba-797d-8f0f-a8d3-46a264186a47",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T12:27:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Donna Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:23:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:23:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hi, good afternoon. I am calling about a streetlight, the one by the crosswalk, it is out. Dark, completely dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:23:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that down. Where is the crosswalk? What street are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:23:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Marsh Street, in The Point. I live at 353 Marsh Street, and the crosswalk is right close to my house, just a little bit down from me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:23:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So 353 Marsh Street, and the light near the crosswalk by there is out. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, exactly. And it is not just a little dim, no way. Nothing. I walk across at night and I cannot see the cars, and they cannot see me. I do not feel safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:24:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Do you know if it's the light itself or the whole pole? Is there a number on the pole, maybe a small tag or sticker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:24:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I do not know. I am on the cell phone, I am in the kitchen, I am not out there. I can go look, but it is cold and, you know, I am seventy-something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:24:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, don't go out in the cold for that. If you don't have the number, the address is enough. We'll use the cross street if you have one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:24:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The cross street I think is, um, [line breaks up] ...the one with the little corner market. I do not remember the name, I am sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:24:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up there for a second. Can you say that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:24:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said I do not remember the cross street name. But it is the crosswalk closest to 353 Marsh. Same side, a few houses down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:25:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Let me read it back. Streetlight out at the crosswalk near 353 Marsh Street, The Point, a few houses down on the same side as you. Caller feels it's unsafe at night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:25:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And I would like a crew to come check the pole. Not just write it down and nothing happens. Somebody to come and look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:25:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request for a crew to check the pole. I can't tell you the exact day they'll get there, but it goes on their list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:25:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but how long? Because this is not the first time I notice. I think maybe two weeks it is dark. I thought somebody else would call, you know. Everybody thinks that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:25:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That happens a lot, honestly. Two weeks, I'll note that too, so they know it's not new."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:26:00-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because I do not read everything that comes. Like the school lunch menus, they come home in a folded sheet, my grandniece's, and I never read, it goes on the pile. So if the city sends a paper about lights, no way I see it. That is why I am calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:26:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, you'd rather just call. Can I get a number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:26:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0185. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Donna Barone. B-A-R-O-N-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Barone. So that's Donna Barone, 353 Marsh Street, dark crosswalk light, crew to check the pole. I've got it all entered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:26:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. I hope they come soon, because the days are short still, it is dark at five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. I've marked it as a safety concern so it's noted. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:27:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you, Lorraine. Bye-bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T12:27:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, bye."
    }
  ],
